","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20345,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词和歌韵自扈跸上都自沙岭至滦京所作 其五","author":"吴当","text":"马群弥野草连云，当年玉帐度秋春。\n迎日捷书频送喜，内间赐与出金银。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20346,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词和歌韵自扈跸上都自沙岭至滦京所作 其六","author":"吴当","text":"羽猎长年从翠华，麋鹿生茸草茁芽。\n射得黄羊充内膳，更喜江南新贡茶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20347,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词和歌韵自扈跸上都自沙岭至滦京所作 其七","author":"吴当","text":"果熟冰盘进御黄，秘殿挥毫对日长。\n元臣补衮应无阙，新赐宫衣自上方。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20348,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词和歌韵自扈跸上都自沙岭至滦京所作 其八","author":"吴当","text":"殿头云气尽成龙，水晶帘影散高春。\n阿母传杯池上宴，帝子吹箫月下逢。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20349,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹枝词和歌韵自扈跸上都自沙岭至滦京所作 其九","author":"吴当","text":"霓旌移仗蕊珠宫，云母屏门不隔风。\n花外侍臣成久立，听得新歌乐意同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":20350,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"青宫受宝朝贺日次韵 其一","author":"吴当","text":"百年文物际重熙，丽日祥云昼刻迟。\n上相传宣催草诏，看君落笔玉堂时。","collection":"元